jsonkit mcp uninstall · Remove this application's MCP server from your coding agents.

USAGE
  jsonkit mcp uninstall [options]

OPTIONS
      --agent <agent>  The agent to remove it from: claude or codex. Every agent it is registered with when left out. One of: claude, codex.

GLOBAL OPTIONS
  -h, --help        Show this help.
  -V, --version     Print the version.
  -M, --manifest    Print this command's manifest as JSON.
  -e, --explain     Explain the selected command and exit.
      --[no-]color  Turn color on or off, overriding NO_COLOR.
  -v, --verbose...  Show more detail. Repeat it for more.
  -q, --quiet       Hide info and success messages.
